        {
          id: "contentLayoutGroup-68",
          type: "contentLayoutGroup",
          children: {
            id: "layoutInlineGroup-42",
            type: "layoutInlineGroup",
            children: [
              {
                id: "text-145",
                type: "text",
                body: "Since the equations at hand do not conform to the standard form of Maxwell's equations, the"
              },
              {
                id: "text-146",
                type: "text",
                body: "fields denoted by "
              },
              {
                id: "inlineMath-54",
                type: "inlineMath",
                body: "\\vb{B}'",
                html: "<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord textbf\">B</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>"
              },
              {
                id: "text-147",
                type: "text",
                body: "and "
              },
              {
                id: "inlineMath-55",
                type: "inlineMath",
                body: "\\vb{E}'",
                html: "<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord textbf\">E</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>"
              },
              {
                id: "text-148",
                type: "text",
                body: "do not represent the transformed electric and"
              },
              {
                id: "text-149",
                type: "text",
                body: "magnetic fields we seek. Substantial effort is required to manipulate these equations into the"
              },
              {
                id: "text-150",
                type: "text",
                body: "correct form that yields the desired fields."
              },
              {
                id: "text-151",
                type: "text",
                body: "We outline below the steps required to derive the relativistic Maxwell equations in a vacuum,"
              },
              {
                id: "text-152",
                type: "text",
                body: "starting with the equations above and manipulating them to obtain the correct form."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
